{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-service-orchestration","title":"多服务编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/multi-service-orchestration","wordCount":718,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"多服务编排\">多服务编排</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>编排要解决的是多服务之间的<strong>启动顺序、就绪判断与配置复用</strong>问题。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>依赖</strong>：<code>depends_on</code> 配合 <code>condition</code>（<code>service_started</code> / <code>service_healthy</code> / <code>service_completed_successfully</code>）表达启动前置条件。</li>\n<li><strong>健康检查</strong>：<code>healthcheck</code> 判断服务是否真正就绪，是可靠依赖的基础。</li>\n<li><strong>扩缩容</strong>：<code>deploy.replicas</code> 或 <code>--scale</code> 水平扩展，需配合负载均衡对外服务。</li>\n<li><strong>复用</strong>：YAML 锚点、<code>extends</code>、<code>profiles</code> 复用配置，多文件组合（<code>-f</code>）管理环境差异。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"服务依赖管理\">服务依赖管理</h2><p>在多服务架构中，服务之间存在启动顺序依赖。Docker Compose 通过 <code>depends_on</code> 配置项管理服务的启动顺序和依赖条件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  api:&#10;    build: ./api&#10;    depends_on:&#10;      db:&#10;        condition: service_healthy&#10;      redis:&#10;        condition: service_healthy&#10;      migrations:&#10;        condition: service_completed_successfully&#10;&#10;  db:&#10;    image: postgres:16-alpine&#10;    healthcheck:&#10;      test: [&#39;CMD-SHELL&#39;, &#39;pg_isready -U postgres&#39;]&#10;      interval: 5s&#10;      timeout: 3s&#10;      retries: 10&#10;&#10;  redis:&#10;    image: redis:7-alpine&#10;    healthcheck:&#10;      test: [&#39;CMD&#39;, &#39;redis-cli&#39;, &#39;ping&#39;]&#10;      interval: 5s&#10;      timeout: 3s&#10;      retries: 10&#10;&#10;  migrations:&#10;    build: ./api&#10;    command: [&#39;node&#39;, &#39;scripts/migrate.js&#39;]&#10;    depends_on:&#10;      db:&#10;        condition: service_healthy\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  api</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    depends_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      db</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service_healthy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service_healthy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      migrations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service_completed_successfully</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  db</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres:16-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    healthcheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CMD-SHELL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pg_isready -U postgres'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis:7-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    healthcheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CMD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'redis-cli'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ping'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  migrations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'scripts/migrate.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    depends_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      db</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service_healthy</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    DB[db&lt;br/&gt;PostgreSQL] --&gt;|healthy| MIG[migrations&lt;br/&gt;数据库迁移]&#10;    DB --&gt;|healthy| API[api&lt;br/&gt;应用服务]&#10;    REDIS[redis] --&gt;|healthy| API&#10;    MIG --&gt;|completed| API&#10;    API --&gt; WEB[web&lt;br/&gt;Nginx 反向代理]\">graph TD\n    DB[db&lt;br/&gt;PostgreSQL] --&gt;|healthy| MIG[migrations&lt;br/&gt;数据库迁移]\n    DB --&gt;|healthy| API[api&lt;br/&gt;应用服务]\n    REDIS[redis] --&gt;|healthy| API\n    MIG --&gt;|completed| API\n    API --&gt; WEB[web&lt;br/&gt;Nginx 反向代理]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>依赖条件</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>service_started</td>\n<td>服务已启动（默认）</td>\n<td>无强依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>service_healthy</td>\n<td>健康检查通过</td>\n<td>数据库、缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>service_completed_successfully</td>\n<td>服务成功退出</td>\n<td>迁移、初始化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 仅使用 <code>depends_on</code> 不带条件只保证启动顺序，不保证服务就绪。数据库等需要初始化时间的服务必须配合 <code>healthcheck</code> 使用 <code>condition: service_healthy</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"健康检查\">健康检查</h2><p>健康检查是可靠编排的基石。通过定义检查命令和频率，Compose 能够准确判断服务是否真正就绪。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  web:&#10;    image: nginx:alpine&#10;    healthcheck:&#10;      test: [&#39;CMD&#39;, &#39;curl&#39;, &#39;-f&#39;, &#39;http://localhost/health&#39;]&#10;      interval: 30s&#10;      timeout: 10s&#10;      retries: 3&#10;      start_period: 40s&#10;      start_interval: 5s&#10;&#10;  api:&#10;    build: ./api&#10;    healthcheck:&#10;      test: [&#39;CMD-SHELL&#39;, &#39;wget --no-verbose --tries=1 --spider http://localhost:3000/health || exit 1&#39;]&#10;      interval: 15s&#10;      timeout: 5s&#10;      retries: 5&#10;      start_period: 30s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  web</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nginx:alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    healthcheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CMD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'curl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-f'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://localhost/health'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      start_period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">40s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      start_interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  api</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    healthcheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CMD-SHELL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wget --no-verbose --tries=1 --spider http://localhost:3000/health || exit 1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">15s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      start_period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker compose ps --format &quot;table {{.Name}}\\t{{.Status}}\\t{{.Health}}&quot;&#10;&#10;docker inspect --format &#39;{{json .State.Health}}&#39; myproject-api-1 | jq .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ps</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"table {{.Name}}\\t{{.Status}}\\t{{.Health}}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> inspect</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{{json .State.Health}}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myproject-api-1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> jq</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>推荐值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>test</td>\n<td>检查命令</td>\n<td>HTTP 端点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>interval</td>\n<td>检查间隔</td>\n<td>10-30s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>timeout</td>\n<td>单次超时</td>\n<td>3-10s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>retries</td>\n<td>失败重试次数</td>\n<td>3-5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>start_period</td>\n<td>初始化宽限期</td>\n<td>20-60s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>start_interval</td>\n<td>宽限期内检查间隔</td>\n<td>3-5s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"服务扩缩容\">服务扩缩容</h2><p>Compose 支持通过 <code>--scale</code> 参数或 <code>deploy.replicas</code> 配置运行多个服务实例。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker compose up -d --scale worker=5&#10;&#10;docker compose ps\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --scale</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> worker=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--sh